  {
   "id": "rick-henderson-113529@post-2021-02-08",
   "gameId": "rick-henderson-113529",
   "displayName": "New perks and new weapon online",
   "kind": "hotfix",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2021-02-08T12:50:26.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Perks",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Short Fuse - Launch mini mines when hit. 10 mini mines are launched in random direction from the player ship when hit. Pretty cool, the mini mines are the same ones from the Bull Hammer weapon.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Razor Rider - Increases Graze radius (default is 0.15, perk increases it to 0.20) - NOT stackable. Makes is quite easy to graze with that kind of radius.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Matrix Stabilizer - Increases Hologram duration by 2 seconds (default is 4) - stackable, so hologram can last a pretty long time.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Photon Stabilizer - Increases Microwarp distance by 5 (default is 10 units) - stackable. Muchos jumpos.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Provisions - Increases Artillery Strike Missile number by 5 (default is 20) - stackable for maximum punch.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Weapons",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Randomizer - Energy weapon that shoots small round bullets that randomly move around the screen, but never backwards. Damage per bullet is not bad (30 per bullet) and the firing rate is good so you can spam the screen with it while waiting for the wave to appear. However, you can't really target with it so it's kind of a gimmick weapon to have fun.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
